# HealthGuard environment configuration — EXAMPLE (copy to .env and fill)
# EVOLVEX IT SOLUTIONS PVT. LTD.
#
# WHY this file exists: real credentials were provided by the client and are
# wired into the local .env ONLY. They are deliberately NOT committed to git
# (see .gitignore) and NOT hardcoded in front-end code — per the project's own
# security rules (no hardcoded secrets, no secret leakage). The front-end reads
# public runtime config via config/site.js; server-side SDKs must use the
# service-role keys from .env exclusively.

